  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<i><b>Enter Birmingham’s criminal underworld as Elisa seeks revenge for her murdered husband. Cohen 1939 pairs Peaky Blinders-inspired gangster atmosphere with the lethal top-down combat of Hotline Miami. </b></i><p></p>\n<p>Your enemies die fast. So do you. Read their positions, choose your moment, and strike before they can react. Every encounter puts your aim, movement, and judgement to the test.</p>\n<p>Stun an enemy with your empty gun, grab a fresh weapon, and keep moving. Chain gunfire, throws, and melee attacks to turn a desperate fight around.</p>\n<p>Four playable characters bring different abilities to the fight, from sliding shots and focused fire to raven summons and rage.</p>\n<p>Approach from a blind spot or make noise to draw enemies towards you. Choose where the fight begins—and who goes down first. A careful approach can give you the opening you need.</p>\n<p>Rain-soaked streets, smoke-filled hideouts, and sharply dressed gangsters set the scene for a bloody reckoning. Follow Elisa into a world of betrayal as she hunts those responsible for her husband’s death.<br>\n</p>",
